 149+ 31A3              ; Receive one ATM -> NeoGS ABI 1.0 frame through ZX DMA.
 150+ 31A3              ; Entry: resident dispatcher consumed E0h from ZXCMD; CBIT remains asserted.
 151+ 31A3              ; Resident code, stack and interrupt handlers must stay in WIN0-WIN2.
 152+ 31A3              ; OUT: carry clear/A=0, HL=#C000 and BC=derived frame size; otherwise
 153+ 31A3              ; carry set/A=status. Production DMA destination is physical 108000h on
 154+ 31A3              ; page 42h, mapped into WIN3 through MPAGEX (#10) using Project125 selector encoding.
 155+ 31A3              ; -------------------------------------------------------------------------
